msgstr ""

#: assets/data/changelog.json
msgid "BLADES IN THEIR OWN COLOURS: Dragonbane swings red, the Obsidian Blade violet, the Blackiron Axe soot-dark, the Warden's Longsword Greyhold steel, Tidecutter sea-green - and bows and staves take their wood and stone too"
