#: assets/data/changelog.json
msgid "BOSSES THAT LAST: Fafnyr and Morvax used to fall in a few seconds, before most of their attacks were ever seen. Now a hero of their level needs about half a minute, long enough for all three phases. Floor guardians and every elite stand up to more blows too"
