msgid "ROADS ACROSS THE ASH FIELDS: paved roads now run from the mountain path west to Blackiron, east to Greyhold and north up the pass to the Frostgate. The orc and wyvern packs that sat beside them have moved off, and Cinderjaw nests in a scorched hollow away from the Frostgate road"
