#: assets/data/changelog.json
msgid "The Hall of Echoes death spike is softened: shades calmed down a little"
msgstr ""

#: assets/data/changelog.json
msgid "The JOURNAL (J) tracks every promise with progress bars and tells you who to see when it's ready"
