msgid "Morvax was one of us once, a hero of Pixelheim. Whatever he is now, it ends at the bottom."
msgstr ""

#: assets/data/progression.json
msgid "Mushrooms for the whole winter! My grandson will be sick of them by spring."
msgstr ""

#: assets/data/progression.json
msgid "My father wore Greyhold's badge till the day the fort fell. If his is still down in those cellars - the guardroom, he always said - I'd like it home."
msgstr ""

#: assets/data/progression.json
msgid "My lute! Slightly chewed. It adds character. Pixelheim gains its first verse tonight."
msgstr ""

#: assets/data/progression.json
msgid "My sister's locket. They took it when they threw me in the cells - the end cell, under the straw."
msgstr ""

#: assets/data/progression.json
msgid "Nightlord"
msgstr ""

#: assets/data/progression.json
msgid "No knife? Doesn't matter. The principle of the thing. Here - and a wedge of the good stuff, later."
msgstr ""

#: assets/data/progression.json
msgid "Nobody spoke for a while."
msgstr ""

#: assets/data/progression.json
msgid "North-east beach, sitting on his chests like a hen. He bites."
msgstr ""

#: assets/data/progression.json
msgid "Not bad for a first brew. Here - the good stuff, brewed proper."
msgstr ""

#: assets/data/progression.json
msgid "Not bad for a landlubber! Keep the rod. The sea's always got more."
msgstr ""

#: assets/data/progression.json
msgid "Now that's a coat. Here - a pearl from the jetty. Make something sharp with it."
msgstr ""

#: assets/data/progression.json
msgid "Off the west gallery, last I heard her. Small cage. Mind your fingers."
msgstr ""

#: assets/data/progression.json
msgid "Oilskin coats made"
msgstr ""

#: assets/data/progression.json
msgid "Ola wants to see you fish."
msgstr ""

#: assets/data/progression.json
msgid "Old Pell's canary is lost in the shafts."
msgstr ""

#: assets/data/progression.json
msgid "Old Tomas says the Deepwood's walking stones trample the mushrooms he forages."
msgstr ""

#: assets/data/progression.json
msgid "Old Wenna wants to know what the smugglers found of her brother Tam."
msgstr ""

#: assets/data/progression.json
msgid "Old steel - the garrison's broken blades. It's all over the yard and the cellars, if you look."
msgstr ""

#: assets/data/progression.json
msgid "Old steel brought"
msgstr ""

#: assets/data/progression.json
msgid "One health potion, brewed by your own hand: a forest herb, a marsh reed, my cauldron. Then we talk."
msgstr ""

#: assets/data/progression.json
msgid "One wheel. Uncut. I'll know if you nibbled."
msgstr ""

#: assets/data/progression.json
msgid "Only what the five climbers left behind will open the mountain's gate."
msgstr ""

#: assets/data/progression.json
msgid "Orc raiders on the Ash Fields keep spooking Wren's riders."
msgstr ""

#: assets/data/progression.json
msgid "Orc raiders sent packing"
msgstr ""

#: assets/data/progression.json
msgid "Orcs from the Ash Fields have been stopping the valley carts."
msgstr ""

#: assets/data/progression.json
msgid "Orcs hold the old watchtower now. Floor five. Bring potions."
msgstr ""

#: assets/data/progression.json
msgid "Ore for Pixelheim"
msgstr ""

#: assets/data/progression.json
msgid "Out of the Ashes"
msgstr ""

#: assets/data/progression.json
msgid "Pathfinder"
msgstr ""

#: assets/data/progression.json
msgid "Perfect. Now the notes are safe. The caravans are another matter."
msgstr ""

#: assets/data/progression.json
msgid "Phantom"
msgstr ""

#: assets/data/progression.json
msgid "Pixelheim is safe. The mountain is quiet, and the tavern isn't."
msgstr ""

#: assets/data/progression.json
msgid "Prelate"
msgstr ""

#: assets/data/progression.json
msgid "Raiders driven off"
msgstr ""

#: assets/data/progression.json
msgid "Raiders on the Ash Road"
msgstr ""

#: assets/data/progression.json
msgid "Real, and terrible, and the regulars will love it. Your drinks are on the house. Well - the first one."
msgstr ""

#: assets/data/progression.json
msgid "Reeds enough to start with. Find me by the shrine - and come to me before you climb."
msgstr ""

#: assets/data/progression.json
msgid "Reeds for a Healer"
msgstr ""

#: assets/data/progression.json
msgid "Reedwoven bucklers made"
msgstr ""

#: assets/data/progression.json
msgid "Relics brought home"
msgstr ""

#: assets/data/progression.json
msgid "Rimefang laid low"
msgstr ""

#: assets/data/progression.json
msgid "Rook in Saltmere swears the smugglers left a cask of their rum in the sea cave. If it's real, I want it behind my bar."
msgstr ""

#: assets/data/progression.json
msgid "Rook wants the smugglers' captain gone - and his take."
msgstr ""

#: assets/data/progression.json
msgid "Rum found"
msgstr ""

#: assets/data/progression.json
msgid "Saint"
msgstr ""

#: assets/data/progression.json
msgid "Saltmere is down the cliffs south of the marsh. Old Wenna there is Tam's sister - start with her."
msgstr ""

#: assets/data/progression.json
msgid "Saltmere's beaches are thick with sea glass, they say. Ground fine, it clears a potion like nothing else. Three pieces, please."
msgstr ""

#: assets/data/progression.json
msgid "Sea Glass for the Still"
msgstr ""

#: assets/data/progression.json
msgid "Sea glass and pelts, sewn tight at a forge. Make me an oilskin coat and I'll make it worth your while."
msgstr ""

#: assets/data/progression.json
msgid "Sea glass brought"
msgstr ""

#: assets/data/progression.json
msgid "Seam Warden laid low"
msgstr ""

#: assets/data/progression.json
msgid "Sela binds your cuts and presses a leather cap into your hands. \"It's not much. Wear it.\""
msgstr ""

#: assets/data/progression.json
msgid "Sela has heard of a cask of rum in Saltmere's sea cave."
msgstr ""

#: assets/data/progression.json
msgid "Sela keeps the inn - or a tent on the square, if that's all there is. She always has a job going."
msgstr ""

#: assets/data/progression.json
msgid "Sela's cellar smells of slime. Thin the forest's supply of them."
msgstr ""

#: assets/data/progression.json
msgid "Set Fafnyr's scale in a fountain on the square"
msgstr ""

#: assets/data/progression.json
msgid "Shadow"
msgstr ""

#: assets/data/progression.json
msgid "Shaft cheese found"
msgstr ""

#: assets/data/progression.json
msgid "She's eating! Look at her go. You can keep the bones."
msgstr ""

#: assets/data/progression.json
msgid "Since the fire, the town cat eats nothing but fresh fish, and Pip has none."
msgstr ""

#: assets/data/progression.json
msgid "Slay Fafnyr on the Ashen Throne (floor 10)"
msgstr ""

#: assets/data/progression.json
msgid "Slime Trouble"
msgstr ""

#: assets/data/progression.json
msgid "Slimes flattened"
msgstr ""

#: assets/data/progression.json
msgid "Slimes nest in the fields east of the town gate. Three of them, and Sela pays."
msgstr ""

#: assets/data/progression.json
msgid "Smells awful. Spins beautifully. Here - a little something from my stores while I get weaving."
msgstr ""

#: assets/data/progression.json
msgid "Smugglers taught manners"
msgstr ""

#: assets/data/progression.json
msgid "Someone has to fish for the caravan's supper."
msgstr ""

#: assets/data/progression.json
msgid "Something guards the seam the Ember Seal's iron came from."
msgstr ""

#: assets/data/progression.json
msgid "Something in the sea cave keeps what the tide brings in - maybe Tam's things too."
msgstr ""

#: assets/data/progression.json
msgid "Something keeps Oskar's shield in the cellars."
msgstr ""

#: assets/data/progression.json
msgid "Something under the Deepwood charges travelers in teeth."
msgstr ""

#: assets/data/progression.json
msgid "Something white sleeps on Liane's lantern under the observatory."
msgstr ""

#: assets/data/progression.json
msgid "Squire"
msgstr ""

#: assets/data/progression.json
msgid "Stand Down"
msgstr ""

#: assets/data/progression.json
msgid "Starcaller"
msgstr ""

#: assets/data/progression.json
msgid "Still locked! The yetis must have given up on it. Here - your share, and then some."
msgstr ""

#: assets/data/progression.json
msgid "Stone golems have taken the cart hall."
msgstr ""

#: assets/data/progression.json
msgid "Stones That Walk"
msgstr ""

#: assets/data/progression.json
msgid "Strongbox recovered"
msgstr ""

#: assets/data/progression.json
msgid "Supper! Real supper. Gunnar will stop complaining for a whole hour."
msgstr ""

#: assets/data/progression.json
msgid "Take the Black Ingot from the Seam Warden, deep in the Blackiron shafts"
msgstr ""

#: assets/data/progression.json
msgid "Take the stair below the hoard: clear the Sunless Stair (floor 11)"
msgstr ""

#: assets/data/progression.json
msgid "Tam, the iron, Oskar, Liane. And the fifth is mine: my promise that someone would finish what we started. Take it. The gate is open, courier - climb."
msgstr ""

#: assets/data/progression.json
msgid "Tell Maren what Fafnyr said about the voice below"
msgstr ""

#: assets/data/progression.json
msgid "That green! The whole valley will want it. Take an antidote - the fen leaves a taste."
msgstr ""

#: assets/data/progression.json
msgid "That'll ring. Not well, but it'll ring. Hilda in Pixelheim could make you something from the rest."
msgstr ""

#: assets/data/progression.json
msgid "That's hers. That's... thank you. Here - it's not much. It's all the turncoats didn't find."
msgstr ""

#: assets/data/progression.json
msgid "That's his ladle. That's Tam's. He stirred soup with it and conducted the whole tavern with it after. Keep it - Maren will know what it means."
msgstr ""

#: assets/data/progression.json
msgid "That's his. The tower's worn right off it from his thumb. Thank you. He kept this for a rainy day, and it's raining."
msgstr ""

#: assets/data/progression.json
msgid "The Ashen Throne"
msgstr ""

#: assets/data/progression.json
msgid "The Black Seam"
msgstr ""

#: assets/data/progression.json
msgid "The Blackiron miners age a cheese down their shafts."
msgstr ""

#: assets/data/progression.json
msgid "The Blackiron road leaves the west edge of the Ash Fields. Foreman Garrick runs the miners' camp."
msgstr ""

#: assets/data/progression.json
msgid "The Captain's Due"
msgstr ""

#: assets/data/progression.json
msgid "The Cart Hall"
msgstr ""

#: assets/data/progression.json
msgid "The Chapel Bell"
msgstr ""

#: assets/data/progression.json
msgid "The Cheese Run"
msgstr ""

#: assets/data/progression.json
msgid "The Deathless"
msgstr ""

#: assets/data/progression.json
msgid "The Fen Fever"
msgstr ""

#: assets/data/progression.json
msgid "The First Deposit"
msgstr ""

#: assets/data/progression.json
msgid "The Five Relics"
msgstr ""

#: assets/data/progression.json
msgid "The Frostgate road climbs north out of the Ash Fields. Aske the hermit has kept Liane's door for fifty years."
msgstr ""

#: assets/data/progression.json
msgid "The Hollow Captain"
msgstr ""

#: assets/data/progression.json
msgid "The Ice Hole"
msgstr ""

#: assets/data/progression.json
msgid "The Lighthouse Lens"
msgstr ""

#: assets/data/progression.json
msgid "The Lost Crew"
msgstr ""

#: assets/data/progression.json
msgid "The Lost Lute"
msgstr ""

#: assets/data/progression.json
msgid "The Lost Strongbox"
msgstr ""

#: assets/data/progression.json
msgid "The Mirefen's ghosts carry a fever into town on the mist."
msgstr ""

#: assets/data/progression.json
msgid "The Missing Canary"
msgstr ""

#: assets/data/progression.json
msgid "The North Road"
msgstr ""

#: assets/data/progression.json
msgid "The Smugglers' Story"
msgstr ""

#: assets/data/progression.json
msgid "The Tidecaller"
msgstr ""

#: assets/data/progression.json
msgid "The Troll Toll"
msgstr ""

#: assets/data/progression.json
msgid "The Turncoats"
msgstr ""

#: assets/data/progression.json
msgid "The board on the square lists what Pixelheim needs next. Lamps first: some coin and three marsh reeds."
msgstr ""

#: assets/data/progression.json
msgid "The board on the square lists what Pixelheim needs to rise again. Sela's inn and the homes around the square first."
msgstr ""

#: assets/data/progression.json
msgid "The caravan road runs through the Deepwood and the trolls take their cut. Two trolls fewer and the bank can pay better."
msgstr ""

#: assets/data/progression.json
msgid "The caravans come through whole. Your savings grow faster now: 3% a day, not 2%."
msgstr ""

#: assets/data/progression.json
msgid "The carts are running! Listen to that racket. Beautiful."
msgstr ""

#: assets/data/progression.json
msgid "The carts came through this morning. Every spool. Take this."
msgstr ""

#: assets/data/progression.json
msgid "The cave mouth is under the western headland, past the lagoon. Mind the steps - and come back."
msgstr ""

#: assets/data/progression.json
msgid "The cellar thanks you. So does my nose. Here - you've earned it."
msgstr ""

#: assets/data/progression.json
msgid "The fen's ghosts bring a fever in on the mist. Lay three of them and I can brew against it."
msgstr ""

#: assets/data/progression.json
msgid "The fire hisses out."
msgstr ""

#: assets/data/progression.json
msgid "The gate's barred, courier. The old wardens sealed it when the five never came home, and only what the five left behind will open it: Tam's ladle in Saltmere, the black iron at Blackiron, Oskar's shield at Greyhold and Liane's lantern on the Frostgate. Bring them home to me."
msgstr ""

#: assets/data/progression.json
msgid "The gate's open. The Ashen Mountain stands north of town, past the bridge; its first floor is the Mossy Cellar."
msgstr ""

#: assets/data/progression.json
msgid "The giant crabs have taken the beach, and the nets with it."
msgstr ""

#: assets/data/progression.json
msgid "The golems of the Sunken Forge still work the bellows for no one. Floor seven."
msgstr ""

#: assets/data/progression.json
msgid "The hounds crumble into cinders. Someone is calling from Upper Street."
msgstr ""

#: assets/data/progression.json
msgid "The lamp's lit. Every boat in the bay saw it last night. Thank you."
msgstr ""

#: assets/data/progression.json
msgid "The last ember gutters out on the stones. Maren is waiting at the shrine."
msgstr ""

#: assets/data/progression.json
msgid "The last of the fires you can reach is out. The square is glowing - embers, blown off the roofs."
msgstr ""

#: assets/data/progression.json
msgid "The letter was for Elder Maren of Pixelheim. You could see the fire from the last hill."
msgstr ""

#: assets/data/progression.json
msgid "The miners at Blackiron age a cheese down the shafts. Black rind, they say, and it hums. I need it. For science."
msgstr ""

#: assets/data/progression.json
msgid "The mist is clean again, and I have brewing to spare. From now on, when I heal you, I top your healing potions up to three."
msgstr ""

#: assets/data/progression.json
msgid "The mountain's gate has been barred since the fire. Maren knows why, and what opens it - ask her."
msgstr ""

#: assets/data/progression.json
msgid "The mountain's gate is barred with old iron and older wards. Nothing passes. Maren will know what opens it."
msgstr ""

#: assets/data/progression.json
msgid "The pass's wolves have gone bold with the cold."
msgstr ""

#: assets/data/progression.json
msgid "The post horses are thin, and Wren's coin is thinner."
msgstr ""

#: assets/data/progression.json
msgid "The road east breathes easier. The village remembers this."
msgstr ""

#: assets/data/progression.json
msgid "The road is clear. My riders taught you to travel light: from now on you walk a tenth faster above ground."
msgstr ""

#: assets/data/progression.json
msgid "The slime was carrying a traveller's pouch: a health potion. {key:inventory} opens your pack."
msgstr ""

#: assets/data/progression.json
msgid "The yard's quiet. First time in years. Now the keep: its door goes down to the cellars, and something down there won't let anyone near the captain's hall."
msgstr ""

#: assets/data/progression.json
msgid "Then we rebuild. With what, I couldn't tell you."
msgstr ""

#: assets/data/progression.json
msgid "There's a hole cut in the lake ice, out past the middle. Stand at its edge, face the water and be patient. Icefin, three of them."
msgstr ""

#: assets/data/progression.json
msgid "There's my girl! Cross as ever. Thank you - the air's safe to breathe as long as she's singing."
msgstr ""

#: assets/data/progression.json
msgid "These will do nicely. One more thing, and I can do more for you than patch you up."
msgstr ""

#: assets/data/progression.json
msgid "They say a thing called the Tidecaller nests in the sea cave under the headland, and keeps what the sea brings in. Tam's things too, maybe."
msgstr ""

#: assets/data/progression.json
msgid "They're at rest. I heard the bell, though there's been no bell here for forty years."
msgstr ""

#: assets/data/progression.json
msgid "They're out - dusty, hungry, alive. And they say the deep seam is open again, and something is guarding it."
msgstr ""

#: assets/data/progression.json
msgid "Three clumps of grave moss. It grows where the fen is quietest. Too quiet, if you ask me."
msgstr ""

#: assets/data/progression.json
msgid "Three fewer raiders on the Ash Fields and my riders can go out again. Mind the big ones."
msgstr ""

#: assets/data/progression.json
msgid "Three fewer slimes in the world and there's coin in it for you."
msgstr ""

#: assets/data/progression.json
msgid "Three fresh fish, please! Saltmere's down the cliffs, south of the marsh - follow the path out of the reeds. Mind the crabs."
msgstr ""

#: assets/data/progression.json
msgid "Three lumps of ore and a pelt for the lining. Forge me a Blackiron helm and the seam's yours to work."
msgstr ""

#: assets/data/progression.json
msgid "Three marsh reeds, and my tent moves to Pixelheim. The marsh east of the gate grows plenty."
msgstr ""

#: assets/data/progression.json
msgid "Three marsh reeds, woven tight, at my forge. Make me a buckler and keep it - it's yours."
msgstr ""

#: assets/data/progression.json
msgid "Three names on a grave in the crypt, and a fourth chiselled away. Maren knew them, I think."
msgstr ""

#: assets/data/progression.json
msgid "Three of the old guard, still at their posts in the cellars. Give them the order they never got."
msgstr ""

#: assets/data/progression.json
msgid "Three of them, north of town where the grass turns grey. The carts bring my thread."
msgstr ""

#: assets/data/progression.json
msgid "Three pieces of sea glass, clear as you can find. They wash up on the beaches and in the cave."
msgstr ""

#: assets/data/progression.json
msgid "Through her door and down the stair, to the glass hall at the back. Her lantern's there - the last thing she lit before the climb. Mind the cold it breathes."
msgstr ""

#: assets/data/progression.json
msgid "Tidecaller laid low"
msgstr ""

#: assets/data/progression.json
msgid "Tight weave. You'll do. Take this for the reeds."
msgstr ""

#: assets/data/progression.json
msgid "Toll-trolls removed"
msgstr ""

#: assets/data/progression.json
msgid "Tracker"
msgstr ""

#: assets/data/progression.json
msgid "Tracks went up toward the observatory. If there's a den in that cave, my box is in it."
msgstr ""

#: assets/data/progression.json
msgid "Trolls relieved of a lute"
msgstr ""

#: assets/data/progression.json
msgid "Trolls tolled"
msgstr ""

#: assets/data/progression.json
msgid "Turncoats driven out"
msgstr ""

#: assets/data/progression.json
msgid "Turncoats hold Greyhold's yard."
msgstr ""

#: assets/data/progression.json
msgid "Two ember shards, ground fine, make an ink that glows under a candle. No forger can match it."
msgstr ""

#: assets/data/progression.json
msgid "Two fish - your own, mind. The end of the jetty is the easy spot."
msgstr ""

#: assets/data/progression.json
msgid "Two gems for the vault's first shelf. Dragons hoard them; so do the deep floors."
msgstr ""

#: assets/data/progression.json
msgid "Two imps. Little red, horns, laughing. One of them has my knife. I'd know it anywhere."
msgstr ""

#: assets/data/progression.json
msgid "Two of the big grey brutes in the Deepwood. Forty years I foraged there in peace."
msgstr ""

#: assets/data/progression.json
msgid "Two of the big ones, gone. Then I'll walk where I please."
msgstr ""

#: assets/data/progression.json
msgid "Two of the walking stones. Hit the joints."
msgstr ""

#: assets/data/progression.json
msgid "Two wolf pelts for saddle leather. The wolves den in the fields east of here - mind their teeth."
msgstr ""

#: assets/data/progression.json
msgid "Vex behind the BREWS door will show you the cauldron. Potions you brew cost you a herb, not a fortune."
msgstr ""

#: assets/data/progression.json
msgid "Vex in Pixelheim pays well for frost lilies."
msgstr ""

#: assets/data/progression.json
msgid "Vex wants Saltmere's sea glass for clearer potions."
msgstr ""

#: assets/data/progression.json
msgid "Vex wants proof you can work a cauldron before she trusts you with the good stuff."
msgstr ""

#: assets/data/progression.json
msgid "Walking stones stilled"
msgstr ""

#: assets/data/progression.json
msgid "Warbringer"
msgstr ""

#: assets/data/progression.json
msgid "Wear the cap Sela gave you ({key:inventory} opens your pack)"
msgstr ""

#: assets/data/progression.json
msgid "Wildlord"
msgstr ""

#: assets/data/progression.json
msgid "Win Tam's Ladle back from the Tidecaller, in Saltmere's sea cave"
msgstr ""

#: assets/data/progression.json
msgid "Wings like sails, fire like - no, don't tell me. I'll find the word."
msgstr ""

#: assets/data/progression.json
msgid "Wolf Watch"
msgstr ""

#: assets/data/progression.json
msgid "Wolf pelts brought"
msgstr ""

#: assets/data/progression.json
msgid "Wolves on the Pass"
msgstr ""

#: assets/data/progression.json
msgid "Wool from the Pass"
msgstr ""

#: assets/data/progression.json
msgid "Wren lost her stable to the fire and walks travelers' horses by the gate."
msgstr ""

#: assets/data/progression.json
msgid "Wyverns for the verse"
msgstr ""

#: assets/data/progression.json
msgid "Wyverns nest in the Stormcrag Aerie, one floor below the dragon. Mind the sky."
msgstr ""

#: assets/data/progression.json
msgid "Yeti fur and a frost lily, woven at a cauldron. A Frostweave hood, for my brother. Please."
msgstr ""

#: assets/data/progression.json
msgid "Yeti fur brought"
msgstr ""

#: assets/data/progression.json
msgid "Yeti fur spins into the warmest thread there is. The Frostgate's full of yetis, I hear. Two pelts' worth?"
msgstr ""

#: assets/data/progression.json
msgid "Yetis carried off the caravan's strongbox."
msgstr ""

#: assets/data/progression.json
msgid "You beat the dragon. Then you've seen the stair behind its hoard. That's where the whispers come from."
msgstr ""

#: assets/data/progression.json
msgid "You carried bad news a long way, and you didn't run from the fire. Stay a while."
msgstr ""

#: assets/data/progression.json
msgid "You fill a bucket at the well."
msgstr ""

#: assets/data/progression.json
msgid "Your hands are empty: the well is on the green, below the square."
msgstr ""

#: assets/data/progression.json
msgid "the Blackiron Mines"
msgstr ""

#: assets/data/progression.json
msgid "the Frostgate pass"
msgstr ""

#: assets/data/story.json
msgid "\"...promised me your village. It lied - to us both.\""
msgstr ""

#: assets/data/story.json
msgid "\"Five went up. Four came down. One went further.\""
msgstr ""

#: assets/data/story.json
msgid "\"I carried a letter,\" you say. \"You broke a seal.\""
msgstr ""

#: assets/data/story.json
msgid "\"Tell Maren... she was right to run.\" Then he is only dust, and the dead around the throne lie down."
msgstr ""

#: assets/data/story.json
msgid "\"The dragon was only ever my door, courier. Thank you for opening it.\""
msgstr ""

#: assets/data/story.json
msgid "\"The voice below...\""
msgstr ""

#: assets/data/story.json
msgid "\"You're late, courier. Fifty years late.\""
msgstr ""

#: assets/data/story.json
msgid "...Of course he did. That was Greyhold."
msgstr ""

#: assets/data/story.json
msgid "A game by Tom Klotz"
msgstr ""

#: assets/data/story.json
msgid "And now the whispers come from below."
msgstr ""

#: assets/data/story.json
msgid "Art by Shade (merchant-shade.itch.io)"
msgstr ""

#: assets/data/story.json
msgid "Behind the Barrow Crypt's guardian: three graves under one stone, and a fourth name chiselled away."
msgstr ""

#: assets/data/story.json
msgid "Behind the hoard, a stairway runs down into the dark."
msgstr ""

#: assets/data/story.json
msgid "Below the hoard, the dead keep their own court."
msgstr ""

#: assets/data/story.json
msgid "Black iron with our five marks on it. We dug the seal's iron at Blackiron ourselves."
msgstr ""

#: assets/data/story.json
msgid "Fafnyr sleeps. It took all five of us to lift the seal onto the chain. Then Morvax found a stair behind the hoard, going down."
msgstr ""

#: assets/data/story.json
msgid "Fafnyr spoke of a voice below. I know whose voice."
msgstr ""

#: assets/data/story.json
msgid "Fafnyr's last breath rattles out of him, and with it, words."
msgstr ""

#: assets/data/story.json
msgid "Fifty years I hated him, courier. I thought I'd feel lighter when he was dust. ...Maybe tomorrow."
msgstr ""

#: assets/data/story.json
msgid "Five lanterns burn on the square tonight. The tavern is loud, and the cheese has never tasted better."
msgstr ""

#: assets/data/story.json
msgid "Frosthowl. Oskar carried me the last mile and complained the whole way. Maren laughed for the first time since we left. I'm writing that down so I remember it."
msgstr ""

#: assets/data/story.json
msgid "Go on, the festival is for you. I'll sit by the fire a while."
msgstr ""

#: assets/data/story.json
msgid "He carried Liane the last mile up and complained the whole way. And Hale kept it fifty years?"
msgstr ""

#: assets/data/story.json
msgid "He has slept on the hoard for a hundred years."
msgstr ""

#: assets/data/story.json
msgid "He isn't dead, courier. He's waiting. Go down and end it - for them, if not for me."
msgstr ""

#: assets/data/story.json
msgid "He said I was right to run? ...Then maybe I can stop running."
msgstr ""

#: assets/data/story.json
msgid "He said a hero who eats well fights well. He was the first to laugh and the first to stand when it went wrong."
msgstr ""

#: assets/data/story.json
msgid "He says the deep holds a power to rebuild the old kingdom. Oskar told him kingdoms are built of people, not gold. They haven't spoken since."
msgstr ""

#: assets/data/story.json
msgid "Her lantern. Liane lit it the night before we climbed and said she'd blow it out herself when we were all home."
msgstr ""

#: assets/data/story.json
msgid "Heroes climbed for its hoard. None came back."
msgstr ""

#: assets/data/story.json
msgid "I was one of the five. Don't look at me like that. Climb, and you'll understand."
msgstr ""

#: assets/data/story.json
msgid "I was so proud of that mark. Look at it. Still there."
msgstr ""

#: assets/data/story.json
msgid "I'm writing in the dark. Tam fell holding the stair. Oskar is still fighting. I told Maren to run, and she ran. Good. Morvax didn't even look back."
msgstr ""

#: assets/data/story.json
msgid "If anyone finds this: Maren got out. Tell her it wasn't her fault. Tell her to seal the stair. - Liane"
msgstr ""

#: assets/data/story.json
msgid "If you find her pages up there, read them. She'd want someone to."
msgstr ""

#: assets/data/story.json
msgid "In one night he burned Pixelheim to the ground."
msgstr ""

#: assets/data/story.json
msgid "It kept him asleep a hundred years. Fifty years ago it cracked, and five fools climbed to make a new one."
msgstr ""

#: assets/data/story.json
msgid "Old names. Old graves. Leave them be, courier - some names are heavier than they look."
msgstr ""

#: assets/data/story.json
msgid "On the anvil lies its twin: an old seal, cracked clean through."
msgstr ""

#: assets/data/story.json
msgid "On the wall above them hangs a shield, its paint gone grey: MORVAX OF PIXELHEIM."
msgstr ""

#: assets/data/story.json
msgid "Once a hero of Pixelheim. Now its oldest debt."
