#: assets/data/story.json
msgid "Pixelheim. A village under a mountain, and glad of it."
msgstr ""

#: assets/data/story.json
msgid "She wrote everything down, you know. Every day of it."
msgstr ""

#: assets/data/story.json
msgid "Sit with me a while. The fire's warm, and for once the mountain is quiet."
msgstr ""

#: assets/data/story.json
msgid "Sit. You've earned the story. The Ember Seal: black iron, forged in the Sunken Forge, set on Fafnyr's chain at the top of the mountain."
msgstr ""

#: assets/data/story.json
msgid "So he's gone. Truly gone."
msgstr ""

#: assets/data/story.json
msgid "Starring"
msgstr ""

#: assets/data/story.json
msgid "Tam's ladle. Gods. He cooked for us all the way up - stew on a mountain, in the snow."
msgstr ""

#: assets/data/story.json
msgid "Tam, Liane, Oskar - they held the stair so I could run. I came home alone and called it a rockfall. Fifty years I've called it a rockfall."
msgstr ""

#: assets/data/story.json
msgid "Thank you for climbing."
msgstr ""

#: assets/data/story.json
msgid "The Sunken Forge's great mould is cold. Something was cast here once - a disc of black iron the size of a cartwheel."
msgstr ""

#: assets/data/story.json
msgid "The Undermountain is open."
msgstr ""

#: assets/data/story.json
msgid "The crack runs from beneath. Someone broke it from below."
msgstr ""

#: assets/data/story.json
msgid "The crypt is older than the village. I read the walls: kings were buried here before the mountain had a name. Morvax lingered by the gold. He always lingers by the gold."
msgstr ""

#: assets/data/story.json
msgid "The mountain is quiet at last, the tavern is loud, and the cheese has never tasted better."
msgstr ""

#: assets/data/story.json
msgid "The old seal is cracking. It sits on Fafnyr's chain, a disc of black iron, warm like something asleep. We have to forge a new one in the Sunken Forge and carry it up."
msgstr ""

#: assets/data/story.json
msgid "The summit is his. So is everything the heroes carried up."
msgstr ""

#: assets/data/story.json
msgid "Then the Ashen Mountain woke, and Fafnyr with it."
msgstr ""

#: assets/data/story.json
msgid "There were five of us. Morvax led. When the seal was set, he went down the stair behind the hoard, and we followed him."
msgstr ""

#: assets/data/story.json
msgid "We cast the new seal from the old one's mould. Morvax watched the fire for a long time and said: 'Imagine what else could be forged down here.' Nobody answered him."
msgstr ""

#: assets/data/story.json
msgid "We followed him down. I wish we hadn't. The dead don't stay dead here. They wait, and they listen to him."
msgstr ""

#: assets/data/story.json
msgid "We set out at first light, five of us, to renew the Ember Seal. Morvax says it will hold another hundred years once it's done. Tam brought cheese. Of course Tam brought cheese."
msgstr ""

#: assets/data/story.json
msgid "Wenna's brother. I should have gone down to Saltmere years ago and told her. I'll go. When this is done, I'll go."
msgstr ""

#: assets/data/story.json
msgid "You bring the blade down. Morvax the Deathless breaks like old glass, and the dark takes what is left of him."
msgstr ""

#: assets/data/story.json
msgid "You dream of a great door in the mountain, and of a dragon asleep against it."
msgstr ""

#: assets/data/story.json
msgid "You dream of a stair, going down and down, and of something waiting at the bottom."
msgstr ""

#: assets/data/story.json
msgid "You dream of five torches climbing the mountain in the dark."
msgstr ""

#: assets/data/story.json
msgid "You found the graves in the crypt. Oskar, Liane, Tam."
msgstr ""

#: assets/data/story.json
msgid "You read him Liane's last page. When you say their names - Tam, Oskar, Liane, Maren - Morvax lowers his hands."
msgstr ""

#: assets/data/story.json
msgid "You wake to the smell of smoke and Sela snoring."
msgstr ""

#: assets/data/story.json
msgid "You wake with your hand on your sword."
msgstr ""

#: assets/data/story.json
msgid "and Infinite Cheese Wheels as themselves"
msgstr ""

#: assets/data/story.json
msgid "of the Ember Five, who held the stair."
msgstr ""

#: assets/data/story.json
msgid "{hero} slew Fafnyr the Ashen above and destroyed Morvax the Deathless below."
msgstr ""

#: assets/data/story.json
msgid "{hero} slew Fafnyr the Ashen above and laid Morvax, once a hero of Pixelheim, to rest below."
msgstr ""

